                    "true": [
                      {
                        "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
                        "args": {
                          "text": [
                            "The janitor came in the other\nday, drunk and in tears. Had \nhalf a record with him, kept\nyelling we gotta fix it somehow.",
                            "I was willing to do it just to shut\nhim up, so I got to get the glue\nfrom cabinet,",
                            "but then he realized he only had\nthe one half, so he ran out.",
                            "Can't do much about the record,\nmaybe ask around at Neely's\nnext time you're there - might be\none of theirs."
                          ],
